usage: module-nav ask [-h] [-n LIMIT] question [question ...]

Answers with `rank`: the classes most relevant to the question, best first. Use `grep` for literal
text in the sources.

positional arguments:
  question           Question in natural language (e.g. 'how does alarm routing work')

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  -n, --limit LIMIT  Max classes to show (default 20)
